  "mod.json": {
   "size": 3874,
   "sha256": "cd30928725182e4c3cdb1ba3cbe3ba2c541fc85b21bc47855a8879e950471bbc",
   "json": {
    "id": "external-item-descriptions",
    "name": "!!~External item descriptions",
    "version": "5.23",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "description": "[img]https://i.imgur.com/l9nbaxP.png[/img]\nThis mod displays detailed information about all items, trinkets, cards, runes and pills DIRECTLY onto your screen. Say goodbye to your browser tab with platinumgod or the wiki open ;)\n\nThe Steam-Workshop version of this mod is compatible with Afterbirth+, Repentance, Repentogon and Repentance+. There are also versions for [url=https://github.com/wofsauge/External-Item-Descriptions#versions]Rebirth or Afterbirth[/url], as well as [url=https://github.com/wofsauge/External-Item-Descriptions/wiki/How-to-install-the-mod]Epic Games, GoG and other sources[/url].\n\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/bRGqujD.png[/img] [url=https://discord.gg/HhD4vMM4bZ]Need help or want to chat? Join our Discord server![/url]\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/P6a8043.png[/img] [url=https://github.com/wofsauge/External-Item-Descriptions]Check this project out on GitHub![/url]\n\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/QmqdAmr.png[/img]\n[list]\n[*] [b]Compatible with Afterbirth+, Repentance and Repentogon[/b]\n[*] Displays information for all collectibles, trinkets, cards, runes, pills, horsepills and some rooms\n[*] Displays [b]additional information[/b] like item type, charges, transformations, Spindown Dice results, Bag of Crafting recipes, TMTRAINER item effects (Detailed informations require REPENTOGON installed!), and much much more!\n[*] Mod support for nearly all mods!\n[*] Extended features available with [url=https://repentogon.com/]Repentogon[/url]\n[*] Easy to use API ([url=https://github.com/wofsauge/External-Item-Descriptions/wiki]Documentation here[/url])\n[*] A huge amount of custom options like:\n[list]\n[*] Indicators\n[*] Font styles\n[*] 17+ Languages\n[*] And a lot of visual options!\n[/list]\n[/list]\n\n[b]Press F2 to hide/show the descriptions![/b]\n\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/NqSBJqj.png[/img]\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/nl8lCfN.png[/img]\nSupported Languages:\nChinese, Czech, Dutch, English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese, Brazilian-Portuguese, Romanian, Russian, Spanish, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese\n\nTo change the language, just edit the \"Language\" setting in the configuration. We recommend to install [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3701683951]'Mod Config Menu Impure'[/url] to easily change the configuration ingame.\n\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/RVtZEqp.png[/img]\nFor [b]Steam users[/b], simply press the \"Subscribe\" button on the mod's Steam Workshop page. This will automatically install the mod for you.\nFor [b]manual mod installation[/b], read this tutorial \"[url=https://github.com/wofsauge/External-Item-Descriptions/wiki/How-to-install-the-mod]How to install the mod[/url]\"\n\nIf you have problems installing use the [url=https://wofsauge.github.io/IsaacDocs/rep/faq/interactive_FAQ.html]Interactive FAQ[/url].\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/PFTZnfC.png[/img]\nSimply install [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3701683951]'Mod Config Menu Impure'[/url]. You can use it to configure the mod while playing.\n\nAlternatively, edit the `eid_config.lua` file like described [url=https://github.com/wofsauge/External-Item-Descriptions/wiki/Edit-the-configuration-manually]here[/url]\n\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/vUP4whT.png[/img]\nThere are multiple Versions of the mod, depending on which DLCs you have installed.\n[b]You are currently looking at the version for Afterbirth+ and Repentance.[/b]\n\n[url=https://github.com/wofsauge/External-Item-Descriptions#versions]Click here for the Rebirth or Afterbirth Versions[/url]\n\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/jrdGbna.png[/img]\n[url=https://github.com/wofsauge/External-Item-Descriptions/blob/master/CREDITS.md]Check out the credits here[/url]"
   }
